<</Type/StructElem/S/Figure/P 323 0 R/Alt(Point range plot showing the predicted percent of Tunisians who trust civil society organizations, with 95% confidence intervals, for people who don't volunteer and people who do, holding the other variables in the model at typical values. About 33% of non-volunteers are predicted to trust organizations, compared to about 38% of volunteers. The confidence intervals overlap.)/A[<</O/Layout/Placement/Block>>]/K[0]/Pg 444 0 R>>
endobj
